---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	galleryImages={[AboutHeroImage]}
>
	<p>
		So if I had to summarise my aim for this amazing blog it would be that this is a
		 little site for me to catalogue all my reviews and current bucket-list for all
		 sorts of albums. This first started all the way back in the not-so-distant past of
		 June 2026 when I turned to myself and said "Man I need to listen to more music!"
		 and so the saga begun.
	</p>

	<p>
		The whole notion of wanting to listen to more music came from the fact that I kept
		hearing about new bands and old classics to the point where I would be able to identify
		a whole collage of albums and artists without being able to any more than one or two songs.
		from them. So initially, I made a grid of bucket-list albums to start listening to similar to 
		the one already on this site only much smaller. It started as 49 albums to which I planned to listen
		to over the summer of 2026. Unfortunately, I got sidetracked and only started near the end of July. 
	</p>

	<p>
		In each page you will find the grid of everything I have listened to in the respective month along with 
		what I consider to be the highlights of said months. I also have a selection of tracks from those "highlight"
		albums.
	</p>

</Layout>
